        {
          "type": "output_text",
          "text": "I identified the work order as **WO-2025-09-004 / MO-25-09-1070**, for Modine’s Racine operation. Its September cost period entered **Pending Close at 2025-09-30T18:00:00**.\n\nI could not determine whether a cost event was created after that time, or verify its source transaction, amount, created time, lateness, or accounting status. The analyst-readable records do not contain the event rows; the supporting records that may contain them are restricted to the records-custodian role. I did not access those restricted records or change any database records.\n\nThe available Oracle 26B policy excerpt says that transactions created after Pending Close are not processed until the period is closed or reopened. Without the event record, I cannot determine whether that policy applies here or whether the recorded status is consistent with it. I submitted the report as incomplete and notified the supervisor that the event evidence is needed.",
